  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM Algeria. With Youth II &#x2013; 2024-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the development cooperation among the parties is &#x201c;Improved protection and well-being of UASC and youth migrants (up to 25 years of age) in Algeria&#x201d;.

The project will assist unaccompanied and separated migrant children and young migrants with quality health services and  assisted voluntary return and reintegration. Over the two year period.</narrative>
  </description>
